    "body": "## Summary\n- Move public `/check-result/:sha` handling ahead of unrelated per-request schema initialization.\n- Add a zero-DB `OPTIONS /check-result/:sha` fast path for public moderation status preflight.\n- Add regression tests proving public status lookup/preflight avoid schema setup.\n\n## Motivation\nModeration status checks are on the playback path and need to be incredibly fast for any client. The worker was doing unrelated D1 table/index initialization before serving public status lookups.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `npx vitest run src/index.test.mjs` — `PASS (147) FAIL (0)`\n- [x] `npm run lint` — passed for 162 module files and 4 HTML files\n- [x] `./node_modules/.bin/wrangler deploy --dry-run` — succeeded\n- [!] `npm test` — Vitest JSON reported `numFailedTests: 0`, but the process exited non-zero with `[vitest-worker]: Timeout calling \"onTaskUpdate\"`\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
